313:             <strong>Références :</strong> Foster C. et al. (2001), <em>"A New Approach to Monitoring Exercise Training"</em>,
314:             Journal of Strength and Conditioning Research, 15(1) · Foster C. (1998), Medicine & Science in Sports & Exercise,
315:             30(7) · Borg G. (1998), Borg's Perceived Exertion and Pain Scales, Human Kinetics.
316:           </p>
317:           <p className="italic" style={{ color: "var(--c-text-3)" }}>Les contraintes sprint, saut, lancer, force ou technique sont présentées séparément comme dimensions descriptives.</p>
